vkd3d-proton: MADEIRA_VKD3D_CAPS_SET and MADEIRA_VKD3D_CAPS_REFUSE

Madeira, 2026-11-27. LGPL-2.1-or-later like vkd3d-proton. Builds on 0009.

With 0009's zero list and binding tier 2, PRAGMATA's answers on vkd3d-proton matched
Madeira's D3D12 except single fields: D3D12_OPTIONS (logic op, PS stencil ref, typed
UAV load formats, ROVs, conservative rasterization, GPU VA bits per resource),
OPTIONS1.TotalLaneCount, SHADER_CACHE.SupportFlags, the tile-based flag, and features
49/53/54, which Madeira's D3D12 refuses. The crash did not move.
MADEIRA_VKD3D_CAPS_SET = "feature:offset=value,..." writes a 32-bit value at a byte
offset of vkd3d-proton's answer (aligned, inside the structure passed); one INFO line
each. MADEIRA_VKD3D_CAPS_REFUSE = feature numbers answered E_INVALIDARG without asking
vkd3d-proton. Both off unless set.

